1. Purpose

This document defines the revised concept, problem, target sectors, product experience, role of artificial intelligence, core functionality, and initial technical direction of TENTORA.

Stage 1 establishes a shared product definition before the formal MVP objectives, scope, stakeholders, deliverables, risks, and success metrics are approved in Stage 2.

Stage 1 outputs

A selected and clearly differentiated product concept.

A defined customer problem.

Five initial project sectors.

Two connected product paths.

Initial product rules and components.

A bounded role for artificial intelligence.

Principles for creative ownership and licensing.

Provisional technical, team, measurement, and risk directions.

